<title>PORTUGAL: Portuguese bonds edge higher, eyes on Fed.</title>
<headline>Portuguese bonds edge higher, eyes on Fed.</headline>
<text>
<p>1730 GMT - Bonds closed higher in line with other peripheries as markets waited to see what the Fed decided on rates. A 25 basis point rise is discounted, traders said.</p>
<p>*June 97 ends 31 basis points up at 105.71</p>
<p>*Feb 07 cash 98.00 vs 97.85. Yld 6.91 vs 6.93</p>
<p>*Spread vs Spanish 10-yr cash -16 bps vs -22 bps</p>
</text>
